# <type>(<scope>): imperative summary — 72 chars max
#
# type:    feat | fix | docs | chore | refactor | test | ci
# scope:   the area touched, e.g. signup, tokens, components, deploy, repo
# subject: imperative mood, no trailing period
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY, wrapped at ~72 columns. End with a
# verification line, e.g.:
#     Verified: deno task check clean; deno task test 10 passed.
#
# NEVER add Co-Authored-By or "Generated with …" trailers — commits are
# attributed to the human author only. The commit-msg hook rejects them.
